pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.contains(&tag.to_string())).collect()
}
```
This returns notes whose `tags` vector contains the exact tag string, preserving relative order.

